      <p class="adt-body text-left leading-relaxed text-zinc-800">
        <span data-id="pg118_n0005">Jona po fliste vazhdimisht p&#xeb;r r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sin&#xeb; e ruajtjes s&#xeb; ambientit, p&#xeb;r r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sin&#xeb; e hedhjes s&#xeb; mbeturinave n&#xeb; vendin e duhur, p&#xeb;r mbjelljen e bim&#xeb;ve, p&#xeb;r p&#xeb;rdorimin sa m&#xeb; t&#xeb; pakt&#xeb; t&#xeb; makinave.</span> <span data-id="pg118_n0006">N&#xeb;na dhe babai i Jon&#xeb;s e d&#xeb;gjonin me v&#xeb;mendje dhe krenoheshin me vajz&#xeb;n e tyre q&#xeb; donte ta ruante ambientin.</span> <span data-id="pg118_n0007">Nj&#xeb; dit&#xeb;, teksa po udh&#xeb;tonin p&#xeb;r te gjysh&#xeb;rit n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; qytet tjet&#xeb;r, Jon&#xeb;s i t&#xeb;rhoqi v&#xeb;mendjen nj&#xeb; autobus i gjat&#xeb; me ngjyr&#xeb; t&#xeb; verdh&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg118_n0008">Disa njer&#xeb;z po rrinin n&#xeb; k&#xeb;mb&#xeb; e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb; ishin t&#xeb; ulur n&#xeb; t&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg118_n0009">Jona pyeti prind&#xeb;rit e saj: - P&#xeb;rse njer&#xeb;zit udh&#xeb;tonin me autobus kur nuk kishin vend dhe duhej t&#xeb; rrinin n&#xeb; k&#xeb;mb&#xeb;?</span> <span data-id="pg118_n0010">Babai buz&#xeb;qeshi dhe e pyeti Jon&#xeb;n: - K&#xeb;ta njer&#xeb;z po i b&#xeb;nin mir&#xeb; ambientit apo d&#xeb;m?</span> <span data-id="pg118_n0011">Jona u mendua pak dhe u p&#xeb;rgjigj: - Natyrisht q&#xeb; po i b&#xeb;nin mir&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg118_n0012">Po t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rdorte secili nga k&#xeb;ta njer&#xeb;z vetur&#xeb;n, at&#xeb;her&#xeb; do t&#xeb; digjeshin m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; l&#xeb;nd&#xeb; djeg&#xeb;se dhe do t&#xeb; ndotej ambienti.</span> <span data-id="pg118_n0013">Sa i dobish&#xeb;m qenka p&#xeb;rdorimi i autobusit, - shtoi ajo.</span> <span data-id="pg118_n0014">N&#xeb;na, e lumturuar nga p&#xeb;rgjigjet e Jon&#xeb;s, shtoi: - Ky lloj transporti quhet transport publik dhe &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i destinuar p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; qytetar&#xeb;t.</span> <span data-id="pg118_n0015">Ai funksionon sipas nj&#xeb; orari, ndjek nj&#xeb; linj&#xeb; rruge t&#xeb; caktuar dhe p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; shfryt&#xeb;zuar at&#xeb; caktohet nj&#xeb; &#xe7;mim standard.</span> <span data-id="pg118_n0016">- Mendoj q&#xeb; edhe ne, - tha Jona, - duhet t&#xeb; udh&#xeb;tojm&#xeb; me transport publik tash e tutje.</span> <span data-id="pg118_n0017">Prind&#xeb;rve u p&#xeb;lqeu ideja e saj.</span>
      </p>
